00:25:49.113 --> 00:25:53.352
From GitHub Blog: Art of play in the age of AI.

00:25:53.457 --> 00:25:59.407
As kids, we spent hours tinkering and building and just messing with things. As

00:25:59.407 --> 00:26:03.949
an adult, I could watch my own young kiddos figure out how certain shapes

00:26:03.949 --> 00:26:10.004
and movement work all day. Through that play, we improved our problem-solving and language

00:26:10.004 --> 00:26:13.838
skills, and it’s probably not a stretch to say it was good for our

00:26:13.838 --> 00:26:19.546
early engineering skills. In this era of development now, we’re starting to get a

00:26:19.546 --> 00:26:25.643
taste of that again. We’re experimenting more, and taking in more changes, because it’s

00:26:25.643 --> 00:26:31.685
all new! For the last four years at GitHub Universe, we’ve had hackable conference

00:26:31.685 --> 00:26:33.360
badges.

