00:26:35.361 --> 00:26:41.592
From Real Python: pandas Project: Make a Gradebook With Python & pandas.

00:26:41.697 --> 00:26:47.508
One of the jobs that all teachers have in common is evaluating students. Whether

00:26:47.508 --> 00:26:54.050
you use exams, homework assignments, quizzes, or projects, you usually have to turn students’

00:26:54.050 --> 00:26:58.980
scores into a letter grade at the end of the term. This often involves

00:26:58.980 --> 00:27:04.508
a bunch of calculations that you might do in a spreadsheet. Instead, you can

00:27:04.508 --> 00:27:10.272
consider using Python and pandas. One problem with using a spreadsheet is that it

00:27:10.272 --> 00:27:14.689
can be hard to see when you make a mistake in a formula. Maybe

00:27:14.689 --> 00:27:20.064
you selected the wrong column and put quizzes where exams should go. Maybe you

00:27:20.064 --> 00:27:23.856
found the maximum of two incorrect values.

